# Files that belong in the repo but not in a release archive.
#
# `git archive` builds the download from tracked files, so the zip is clean by construction — no
# Binaries/, Intermediate/ or Saved/ can leak into it, because they were never committed. These are the
# few things that *are* committed but mean nothing to someone dropping the plugin into their project.
.gitignore      export-ignore
.gitattributes  export-ignore
.github/        export-ignore
